{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"1142710","name":"全面战争：战锤3","type":"game","about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/4399b64b745c1a2f0c3a90f5c8958dcd.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/868c3d11f98ec6a6d25501bded60d988.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>垂死的神明最后一声咆哮打破了世界之间的界限，开启了通向混沌魔域的传送门。恐虐、纳垢、奸奇、色孽，这四股毁灭之力从漩涡之中涌现了出来，它们四处散布着黑暗与绝望。<br><br>基斯里夫坚毅的勇士和幅员辽阔的震旦天朝就在风口浪尖之上，而一位恶魔亲王正在寻仇，他发誓要消灭那些腐蚀他的人。即将到来的风波将会吞噬一切。你会征服你的恶魔，还是让它们听令于你？ <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/cb704e9e94a3a9f82c2795fa3a47d53c.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>你可以控制七个各具特色的种族以及数百种部队来打造一支军队，在那令人叹为观止的壮观世界里，纵横于史诗般的即时战斗之中。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/53594a7d48dcf7a7ec302bb0addd31d1.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/f7005d773cb763558e117e4495dcca65.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>这是迄今为止最具雄心也是最具新意的《Total War》游戏，那引人入胜的叙事将让你代入到游戏之中，这会让你进入魔幻的混沌魔域之中，然后再回到凡世之中。在战略沙盒之中打造你的帝国，这沙盒之中每一场战役都是独一无二的。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/0d04020f1bac73bca6cdb2710c63d3f0.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/ca096cd20c8595f5e46d8c5e391f0cc5.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>有10位传奇领主可供扮演！你会选择站在混沌诸神的一边进行他们的恶魔战役，还是选择扮演震旦天朝的远古化形神龙？是与冰雪女王一起守护基斯里夫的冰封国度，还是扮演恶魔亲王来成为终极反派？<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/0e90bfa944229bb57cd64e99e3720ecf.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/953e6a3b797e02253b64bab09565aab4.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>用海量的身体部件和力量定制你独一无二的恶魔亲王，你有无数种潜在的组合方式来配合你自己的游戏风格<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/694fe09d6942684f8f104b301ed29250.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=344 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/ad9631a5859bf15fa8b691a1bd7b3232.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=83 /></span><br>多人游戏的规模现在比以往更加庞大。混沌魔域的宏大多人战役可容纳8名玩家，还有紧张刺激的一对一君临模式，以基斯里夫和震旦为基础的剧情多人战役，还有排名与自定义战斗等等，想要与朋友来几场大混战，办法有的是。<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/extras/344243864c93aecc3521c90c0528c6da.avif?t=1779441058\" width=616 height=344 /></span>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/44216108890c379598fe53c878c27bf397d8cf60/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1779441058","website":"https://warhammer3.totalwar.com/","developers":["CREATIVE ASSEMBLY","Feral Interactive"],"publishers":["SEGA","Feral Interactive"],"release_date":"2022 年 2 月 16 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"EUR","initial":"59.99","final":"8.99","discount":85},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 捷克语, 韩语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 俄语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 土耳其语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":true},"categories":["单人","多人","玩家对战","线上玩家对战","局域网玩家对战","合作","在线合作","局域网合作","Steam 成就","Steam 集换式卡牌","视角舒适度","可选颜色","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","无需应对快速反应事件","随时保存","立体声","环绕声","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","策略"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统 *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i3/Ryzen 3 series<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GTX 900/AMD RX 400 series | Intel Iris Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 120 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> This game may be updated over time and have paid for and free. additional content released for it. Please be aware that this may increase the minimum requirements for running the game above the specification stated here. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i5/Ryzen 5 series<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 Ti/AMD RX 5600-XT/Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 120 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> 8GB Memory if using integrated GPU. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions.</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/ss_6149b0570c42cda0e40b4de71e6f48bbe5c4c577.600x338.jpg?t=1779441058","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/ss_6149b0570c42cda0e40b4de71e6f48bbe5c4c577.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779441058"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142710/ss_320f5373c16e33f50c0ee2ccc822344c0e0d5f8d.600x338.jpg?t=1779441